OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be cloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, the rain heavy and
OL,7,Fpersistent at times. Turning more
OL,8,Fshowery through the afternoon with
OL,9,Foccasional brighter spells. Breezy,
OL,10,Fstrong coastal winds during the
OL,11,Fmorning.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRemaining mostly cloudy and
OL,14,Fshowery during this evening. The
OL,15,Fshowers becoming well scattered
OL,16,Fovernight with drier and clearer
OL,17,Fspells. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
