OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA bright day with sunny spells
OL,6,Fand a scattering of showers. The
OL,7,Fshowers dying back towards the west
OL,8,Fcoast during the afternoon, then
OL,9,Fmainly dry through the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FWet
OL,12,Fand windy early on Saturday, turning
OL,13,Fdrier and brighter from the west.
OL,14,FMainly dry and bright on Sunday then
OL,15,Fcloudy with outbreaks of rain on
OL,16,FMonday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
